      "message": "exp009 experiment receipt: seal qcells-lab budget-length control sweep (6-gate ceiling NOT binding — the no-op is proven, not assumed) - isolation test for the one structural variable every frozen-unaided verdict was recorded under; budget swept 6/8/12 on the doctrine lane (seedA GHZ3 skeleton, n=4 GHZ balance, restrict=('replace','indel'), same named seeds) with byte-identical outcomes at every arm: same exp008 non-canonical champion [h(0),cx(0,1),crx(pi,1,3),cx(1,2)], same crossing gen 5, same held-out verify 0.4824; no-op mechanism proven from telemetry (max_champion_len_seen=4 at every budget < 6; budget only enters the move choice at len>=budget, which never occurs) so the exp005-008 frozen verdicts stand as engine laws, not leash artifacts; identical is the honest result, anti-laundering rationale recorded in-receipt; control reproduces exp001 byte-for-byte in-harness; 19 witness-ledger rows, PROOF head ef538852ee95f4ad, replay OK; 10 pins (chain re-derived in-repo, seed-in-WORLD-row, executable champion w/ live histogram train+verify, crx pi-expansion load-bearing honesty pin, control guard, budget-sweep-noop across all three arms incl. identical curves + telemetry ceiling headroom, seed birth zero-fitness, honest-limit scope, tamper trip); FAIL-first 10 errors on pristine main; baseline unchanged (branch off merged exp005 seal HEAD 125b0f5, same base as open #11/#12/#13, independent files); suite 71/71 green",
